# MT Andaman 30m Autonomous Tugboat digital-twin ArduRover defaults.
#
# Represents the 30-metre autonomous harbour tug MT Andaman certified by the
# Indian Register of Shipping (IRS) in collaboration with Mazagon Dock
# Shipbuilders Ltd (MDL) and Robosys Automation (Voyager AI).
#
# Real Naval Architecture Specifications:
#   Length Overall (LOA): 30.0 m
#   Beam Overall (B): 9.0 m
#   Draft (T): 3.2 m
#   Displacement: 280-320 metric tonnes
#   Propulsion: Twin Azimuth Stern Drive (ASD) / Steerable Kort Nozzles
#   Bollard Pull: 40-45 tonnes
#   Operational Speed: 5.5 m/s (~11 knots cruise)
#
# Steering: Skid-steer / twin differential azimuth thrusters
SERVO1_FUNCTION 73
SERVO3_FUNCTION 74

# Heavy Displacement Harbour Tug Dynamics:
# Cruising speed ~5.5 m/s (10.7 knots); waypoint transit ~5.0 m/s (9.7 knots)
ARMING_CHECK 0
CRUISE_SPEED 5.5
WP_SPEED 5.0
CRUISE_THROTTLE 65.0
SPEED_TURN_GAIN 80.0
ATC_STR_RAT_FF 0.45
ATC_STR_RAT_P 0.35
ATC_STR_RAT_I 0.15
ATC_SPEED_P 1.8
ATC_ACCEL_MAX 0.8
PIVOT_TURN_ANGLE 30
